  m_Text: "Controls:\n\nPress 1 to swap weapons\nPress R to reload\nHold Shift to
    sprint\nLeft Mouse Button to shoot\nRight Mouse Button to aim\n\nNote: Bullet
    sizes are intentionally large for easier collision detection.\nThis is an early
    pre-alpha build \u2014 everything is still a work in progress!\n\nAdditional
    Features:\n\nEnemies have advanced AI for tracking and following the player.\n\nThe
    Mystery Box is a fully functional station with multiple guns to choose from."
